.vscode/

# Guides and reports stay private: of the Markdown files, only README.md is published
*.md
!/README.md

# Student records stay off GitHub. AESRI's own records go in data/ (read first, never published).
# Of the CSV files, only the dataset supplied with the project is kept; predictions you write
# (reports/test-predictions.csv, predictions.csv, ...) and spreadsheets stay on your computer.
/data/
*.csv
!/train_students.csv
!/validation_students.csv
!/test_students.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Stud-AI has no settings file: its settings come from the portal server's configuration.
.env*
